{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12226350","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12226350","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1222635001:1":{"text":"Lucca's still out cold... We need to discuss our next step.","source_cn":"卢卡还在昏迷中……我们先聊聊吧。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE9670C9065062965","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Lucca's still out cold... We need to discuss our next step.","female":"Lucca's still out cold... We need to discuss our next step.","variant_male_record_index":"137613","variant_female_record_index":"137614","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1222635002:1":{"text":"Can you explain what exactly happened?","source_cn":"方便和我说说事情的详细经过吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF39F90543073BDB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1222635003:0":{"text":"You and the others tell Sonja everything that happened so far...","source_cn":"将这一路的遭遇转述给索尼娅后——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EAD7D496B9D8D25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1222635004:1":{"text":"So an assassin from the Bantus Empire stole the Void Relic...","source_cn":"班题斯帝国的杀手抢走了圣器……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B087C6CD538B48A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222635005:1":{"text":"We might have caught a big fish with this trap, but it cost us dearly.","source_cn":"这次撒饵抛钩，似乎钓上了一条大鱼，但我们也付出了不小的代价。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x590F4816CA7B1793","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222635006:1":{"text":"*Sniffle* Lucca will be alright, won't he?","source_cn":"卢卡他没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD983E000209FB98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222635007:1":{"text":"He's not in immediate danger, but that assassin was brutal. Every blow hit a vital spot—he's seriously hurt.","source_cn":"没有生命危险，但那名杀手毫不留情，每一刀都直击要害，卢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69DA3D8B996DD64F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222635008:1":{"text":"Speaking of which, Bonnie's hurt too, but her injuries aren't as bad.","source_cn":"说起来，波妮身上也有伤，却伤得并不重，这让我有些想不通。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2C8A0682B0ACFD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1222635009:1":{"text":"Why would the assassin hold back against Bonnie?","source_cn":"那个杀手为什么会对波妮手下留情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE99716020895ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1222635009":{"text":"Why would the assassin hold back against Bonnie?","source_cn":"那个杀手为什么会对波妮手下留情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CE99716020895ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1222635010:1":{"text":"Wasn't Bonnie created by Hodgkin using the Void Relic? That must've happened after he left the empire. Would that assassin know her?","source_cn":"波妮是霍德希金离开班题斯帝国后才收为下属的吧？那个杀手...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A2C5513F61EB2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1222635011:1":{"text":"Hm... Probably not, since Bonnie doesn't even know her name.","source_cn":"嗯……至少波妮完全不知道她的名字呢，应该不太熟吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B46C543919B39ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222635013:1":{"text":"Could it be because they're both women?","source_cn":"总不会因为都是女性，所以手下留情了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA46B265EFFF13495","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222635014:1":{"text":"We can't rule that out, I suppose.","source_cn":"不能排除这个可能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94B59A8F96AA1969","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222635015:1":{"text":"Interesting. At least we can assume she's more likely to spare women.","source_cn":"有意思。至少，我们对她不是一无所知了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24C21B167683EFE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222635016:1":{"text":"That could be useful for our strategy.","source_cn":"如果她会对女性手下留情，我们的应对策略可以考虑这一点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F136DE292B90260","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1222635017:1":{"text":"Anders, reporting! The items you requested are ready!","source_cn":"报告！您要的东西我们已经做好了，请过目！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A9F3B9F45C87452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:22::0":{"text":"Wanted Poster","source_cn":"血薇帮的通缉令","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2F845274DEF8331","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1222635018:1":{"text":"Well done. As for your next task, post them all over Rustport.","source_cn":"很好，辛苦了。你们还有新的任务，把它们张贴在锈锚港各处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E7D2A57420F545D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1222635019:1":{"text":"Sonja, are these... wanted posters?","source_cn":"索尼娅，这好像是……通缉令？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9255315880F419B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1222635020:1":{"text":"Yes, Bonnie did the sketches.","source_cn":"不错，通缉令上的画像，出自波妮之手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE408999885461A5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:27:1222635020":{"text":"Yes, Bonnie did the sketches.","source_cn":"不错，通缉令上的画像，出自波妮之手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE408999885461A5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1222635021:0":{"text":"It's surprising, isn't it? She's captured the assassin's features quite well. She has some talent.","source_cn":"是啊，人物特点突出，她有些艺术天分。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECF460AFAD04BEB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1222635022:1":{"text":"Regardless, I didn't expect Bonnie to cooperate, but she's been a big help.","source_cn":"不管怎么说，我也没想到波妮愿意配合，帮大忙了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6716F2C8A842E81B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1222635023:1":{"text":"Are you hoping to get help from the locals in Rustport?","source_cn":"你打算借助锈锚港居民的力量，抓住那个杀手吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1E45498000A06C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1222635024:1":{"text":"Yes. Now that she's got the relic, her next move will be to flee.","source_cn":"是的。既然那人已经得到了圣器，她一定想尽快离开锈锚港。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x278817C8A442DFC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1222635025:1":{"text":"She'll probably try to escape by sea.","source_cn":"她唯一的选择，是坐船出海。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7663439DC7394A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1222635026:1":{"text":"With these posters everywhere and a huge bounty on her head, it's only a matter of time before we catch her, unless she somehow grows wings.","source_cn":"这些通缉令将遍布全城，我开出了高昂的赏金，除非她能展翅...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09AFB5DBF7AB060B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1222635027:1":{"text":"The Carmine Whispers will settle this with blood. She won't slip past us!","source_cn":"血薇帮以血还血，在我的地盘放肆，她逃不走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A4DA045A34FCA2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1222635028:1":{"text":"Is there anything we can do to help? Chippy wants to help Lucca out!","source_cn":"索尼娅，有我们能帮上忙的地方吗？我们也想替卢卡出份力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E2644BF9EBB9C9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1222635029:1":{"text":"Then I'll rely on you.","source_cn":"那我就不客气地拜托各位了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20AD134F5C952434","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1222635030:0":{"text":"First, please put up some of these wanted posters. I've sent out many of my men to strengthen the patrols, so we're a little short-handed.","source_cn":"首先得麻烦各位帮忙张贴一些通缉令，为了加强巡防，我们派...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB86EA49C029EF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1222635031:1":{"text":"Also, head to the docks and let the guards know to be extra vigilant.","source_cn":"另外，请去码头给那里的警卫带个话，告诉他们务必提高警惕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD658047EFEC63E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1222635032:1":{"text":"Finally, I need you to visit an informant named Grayfang. Have him report any recent rumors, and make sure he's telling the truth.","source_cn":"最后，想让各位去找一位情报贩子，他的外号叫灰舌，让他把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF07C2DCA97D4D39F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1222635033:1":{"text":"O-oh! That's quite a list of tasks... You weren't kidding when you said you'd rely on us!","source_cn":"还真是不客气呢……竟然有这么多任务。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x142106EC0C098C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1222635034:1":{"text":"Sorry, but the situation is urgent.","source_cn":"抱歉，因为情况着实紧急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CFB82176F0DEEA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1222635035:1":{"text":"It's fine, we'll take it one step at a time!","source_cn":"没关系，我们一样一样来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D955255A3947B80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:0:1":{"text":"Wow, she's very talented.","source_cn":"画得真好啊","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB62FE25179264054","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Wow, she's very talented.","female":"Wow, she's very talented.","variant_male_record_index":"66948","variant_female_record_index":"66949","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:27:1:2":{"text":"I bet I could do better.","source_cn":"画得一般般","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5A7B2F5EFDBDD5BC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"I bet I could do better.","female":"I bet I could do better.","variant_male_record_index":"66950","variant_female_record_index":"66951","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:0:1":{"text":"Maybe they know each other?","source_cn":"因为她认识波妮？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x14258F43EF5542AD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Maybe they know each other?","female":"Maybe they know each other?","variant_male_record_index":"66944","variant_female_record_index":"66945","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1222635012:1":{"text":"But the Graveborn don't really care about each other as kin.","source_cn":"可是对于亡灵来说，他们彼此之间没什么认同感，也不在乎所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA5A6C4F164F1684","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:12:1:2":{"text":"Because they're both Graveborn?","source_cn":"因为她也是亡灵？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x0B6ED9427660C247","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Because they're both Graveborn?","female":"Because they're both Graveborn?","variant_male_record_index":"66946","variant_female_record_index":"66947","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"